	ISZ	PQSTO			/BUMP TO NEXT
	ISZ	MV2CNT			/MOVED ENOUGH WORDS?
ZZ1076,	JMP	MOVPQS			/NO, GO BACK
	JMP	OOUTLUP			/YES, GO START IT THERE

